Package: zig
Name: Zig
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: build-essential, ldid, libiosexec1 (>= 1.3.1)
Recommends: clang-19 | clang, ld64
Suggests: llvm-19 | llvm
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://ziglang.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Zig programming language compiler
 Zig 0.16.0 toolchain for rootless jailbroken iOS (iphoneos-arm64). Provides
 zig build and zig build-exe for aarch64-ios on-device. Does not replace the
 system C compiler; use clang from build-essential when C interop is needed.
 .
 The shipped zig binary embeds LLVM. Executables it produces (and zig itself)
 must be signed with ldid using the entitlements plist under
 /var/jb/usr/lib/zig-0.16.0/.
